{"sections":[{"slug":"形式特征","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形式特征"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">形式特征</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“形式特征”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathscr C = \\Big\\{ M \\in \\mathfrak g\\mathsf {-Mod}\\colon  M = \\bigoplus_{\\lambda \\in\\Lambda } M_{\\lambda }, \\dim_{\\mathbb{C}}M_\\lambda &lt;+\\infty \\Big\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$\\operatorname{ch}$</p>\n"}}}]}